<native:scroll-view class="w-full flex-1 bg-theme-background">
    <native:column class="w-full p-4 pb-8 gap-4">
        <native:text class="text-xl font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Firstlight Showcase Privacy Policy</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-sm text-theme-on-surface-variant">Last updated: 25 October 2026</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">Firstlight Showcase is an interactive native interface reference from Firstlight UI. No account is required.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Data collection</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">The app does not transmit your form entries, selected media or usage history to Firstlight UI. It contains no advertising or analytics SDKs.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">On-device data</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">Sample records, preferences and media you choose are processed in the app on your device. Some are saved in local app storage. Device backups may include app data according to your operating system and backup settings. Removing the app removes its local app data; copies in backups are managed through your backup service.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Camera, photos and files</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">The Media examples can use the camera or system photo and document pickers when you choose those actions. Selected files may be copied into the app's local storage so you can try previewing, cropping and validation. The app does not upload them. Use the Media screen's clear controls to remove its saved copies. Permission can be managed in device settings.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Sample content</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">Bookings, messages and other example records are fictional. Booking actions do not make real reservations or charge money. The settings recipe saves sample preferences locally and does not send email or register push notifications.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Apple and Google services</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">The App Store, Google Play, operating system diagnostics and device backup services are governed by their providers' privacy policies and your settings. If you contact support, Firstlight UI receives the information you choose to include and uses it to respond.</native:text>

        <native:text class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-on-surface">Privacy and support contact</native:text>
        <native:text class="text-base text-theme-on-surface">team@firstlightui.dev</native:text>
    </native:column>
</native:scroll-view>
